    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="3955e79e-57aa-5dc9-ae7c-704edfca355b" activityNameId="9ed4d07e-b1bc-5796-a0e4-d48b331a3337" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, silencer for ventilator unit 6700 m3/h, modular</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, silencer for ventilator unit 6700 m3/h, modular
Disposal of a silencer for a air handling unit with 6700 m3/h nominal air flow rate (at 2 m/s air speed in cross section of air filter or heat exchanger) kg/(m3/h), total weight: 0.024 kg/(m3/h), including a frame construction, casing, silencer baffle with section length 900mm. The frame construction made of aluminium-profiles, casing made of hot-dip galvanized and powder coated steel sheets insulated with polyurethane foam, rock wool as sound-absorbing media.
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location:  Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces, copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on production input data
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ed572d6c-4788-4b0c-8894-09fa6b1036bd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
